    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cat and Dog want to go adventure to the outside world.This world is full of dangers and traps.\u00a0They have to cooperate with each other and use their own abilities to solve puzzles\u00a0and overcome obstades to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D platform adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzle\u00a0and obstades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Characters with different abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump distance is high</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't swim</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lie on the dog's head</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw: Fishbone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand up, Throw: Key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dog:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump distance is short</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand up, Throw: Chest, Spring, Key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break brick</p>",
